<title>SPAIN: Spain inflation seen under 3.5 pct by end 96 - Rojo.</title>
<headline>Spain inflation seen under 3.5 pct by end 96 - Rojo.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Spain governor Luis Angel Rojo said on Wednesday that he expects to see consumer inflation under 3.5 percent by the end of the year.  </p>
<p>&quot;At the end of this year inflation is going to be below 3.5 percent and it below 3.5 percent in 1997,&quot; Rojo told an economic committee of parliament.</p>
<p>Spanish consumer inflation remained unchanged at 3.7 percent in August.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
